{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_vrtx_01Gyk9KfLASGoAZ5LR7TbGW6","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The file has been written to `/Users/sarthakagarwal/Desktop/projects/prep/system-design/payments-system/answers/03-state-management-transaction-lifecycle.md`.\n\nHere's what's in the ~7,200-word document:\n\n---\n\n**## Core (7 answers)**\n\n| Q | Topic | Highlights |\n|---|-------|------------|\n| Q1 | PaymentIntent FSM → UI rendering | `stateDiagram-v2` of all PI states, React `switch` render function, `handleNextAction()` for 3DS, polling strategy for `processing` |\n| Q2 | Idempotency & safe retries | `getOrCreateIdempotencyKey()` with `crypto.randomUUID()` + `sessionStorage`, `Idempotency-Key` header, PI-as-natural-idempotency |\n| Q3 | Optimistic UI limits | Hybrid by risk level — optimistic for cart mutations, pessimistic-with-pending-spinner for actual charge, rollback strategy |\n| Q4 | State persistence across refresh | 3-tier model (URL params / sessionStorage / server session), `rehydrateCheckoutState()`, what to **never** persist (PAN, CVV, client_secret in localStorage) |\n| Q5 | Tab close during `processing` | `handleReEntry()` status switch with all recovery paths, exponential-backoff polling loop for `processing` state |\n| Q6 | Concurrent tab conflicts | `BroadcastChannel` API with `CART_UPDATED` / `PAYMENT_INITIATED` events, optimistic locking + 409 Conflict handling |\n| Q7 | Ad blocker strips redirect params | `resolvePaymentStatus()` with layered fallback (URL params → server poll → `stripe.retrievePaymentIntent()`), Mermaid resolution flowchart |\n\n**## Deep (3 answers)**\n\n| Q | Topic | Highlights |\n|---|-------|------------|\n| D1 | Soft-decline retry loop | `RETRY_CONFIG` with soft/hard decline code sets, full `attemptPayment()` loop, `stateDiagram-v2` of retry transitions |\n| D2 | XState payment machine | Complete v4 `createMachine` with 8 states (`idle`, `submitting`, `requiresAction`, `processing`, `softDeclined`, `networkError`, `hardDeclined`, `succeeded`), all guards/actions/services, `useMachine` React integration |\n| D3 | WebView postMessage bridge | iOS/Android unified bridge abstraction, ACK protocol with exponential backoff, 5 failure modes + mitigations, Swift `WKScriptMessageHandler` pseudocode, architecture flowchart |"},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a32f04247f829a9c3 (use SendMessage with to: 'a32f04247f829a9c3' to continue this agent)\n<usage>subagent_tokens: 30938\ntool_uses: 1\nduration_ms: 705143</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_vrtx_01Gm2R7pu2ErKki4kJYC5umx","session_id":"3b5e4a3c-6477-40c1-bb5a-cf9fbc849288","uuid":"ed7c42d6-76c9-487b-9e86-800380432518","timestamp":"2026-06-20T18:57:07.143Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Write answers for section 03: State Management & Transaction Lifecycle"}
